  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When creating Binary resources then reindexing, I observed that the count of NonRdfSourceDescription and all resources at the fcr:stats endpoint was changing after a subsequent reindexing. After more testing, it appears that when adding binaries the NonRdfSourceDescription entry is generally not being added, although I did observe that when I run a bulk object creation script that the NonRdfSourceDescription count goes up about half as much as the Binary count.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To verify this issue, run ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "mvn jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " on main, go to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8088/rest/fcr:stats"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:stats",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "You should see all zeros (assuming you were starting fresh). Then create a couple binaries in the UI, and visit fcr:stats again. You should now see the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Binary",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " count equal to the number of binaries you created, but there are no ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "NonRdfSourceDescription",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " entries.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Next, stop jetty, and then run it with reindexing turned on:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "mvn -Dfcrepo.rebuild=true -rf fcrepo-webapp jetty:run",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Now go to fcr:stats again, and there will be a ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "NonRdfSourceDescription",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " count equal to the number of binaries. The ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "resource_count",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " also will have gone up, since it includes the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "NonRdfSourceDescriptions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
